  "question": "Given $Z = 2x + 7y$ and the constraint $x + 3y = 12$, what is $Z$, if $y = 4$?",
  "answeroption": "B",
  "explanation": "If $y = 4$, then $x + 3\\times 4 = 12 \\implies x + 12 = 12 \\implies x = 0$<br /><br />$Z = 2\\times 0 + 7\\times 4 = 28$<br /><br />So, $Z = 28$ when $y = 4$.",
